00:00:19.453 --> 00:00:24.058 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Des troupeaux de moutons

00:00:21.021 --> 00:00:24.091 size:53% position:73% line:53%
traversent à l'improviste,

00:00:22.656 --> 00:00:24.125 size:53% position:73% line:53%
en quête de verdure,

00:00:24.258 --> 00:00:28.863 size:53% position:73% line:53%
car plus on avance,

00:00:25.860 --> 00:00:30.297 size:53% position:73% line:53%
